category: Libs
requires: libglib2.0-devel libticables2_7 pkg-config
sdesc: "Library to handle different link cables for TI calculators (development)"
ldesc: "The ticables library is a multi-platform library (Linux, Windows, Mac OS-X)
which handles all link cables through a set of functions which constitutes a
common API. Either directly (raw access), either trough a driver."
external-source: libticables2

